    "id": "hero",
    "nome": "Hero",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<style>\n.fp{--ink:#14181f;--mut:#5b6472;--line:#e8ebf0;--acc:#1f6f5c;--soft:#f5f7f6;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;font-family:inherit}\n.fp *{box-sizing:border-box}.fp section{padding:72px 20px}.fp .w{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}\n.fp h1{font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,60px);line-height:1.08;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 18px;text-align:center}\n.fp h2{font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,38px);line-height:1.15;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 14px}\n.fp p{color:var(--mut);font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}\n.fp .c{text-align:center}.fp .c p{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto}\n.fp .btns{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n.fp .b{display:inline-block;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid var(--ink);color:var(--ink);background:#fff}\n.fp .b.p{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}.fp .b:hover{opacity:.85}\n.fp .ppl{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(12px,4vw,40px);margin-top:48px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.fp .pp{text-align:center;width:min(220px,28vw);min-width:130px}.fp .pp svg{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:28px;display:block}\n.fp .pp b{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:17px}.fp .pp span{color:var(--mut);font-size:14px}\n.fp .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;padding:36px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.fp .row:nth-child(even) .t{order:2}.fp .n{color:var(--acc);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}\n.fp .viz{background:var(--soft);border-radius:24px;min-height:200px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:64px}\n.fp .gr{background:var(--soft)}.fp .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center;margin-top:28px}\n.fp .chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px}\n@media(max-width:760px){.fp .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}.fp .row:nth-child(even) .t{order:0}.fp section{padding:52px 18px}}\n.fp .hero{min-height:calc(100vh - var(--hh,80px));min-height:calc(100svh - var(--hh,80px));display:flex;align-items:center;padding:clamp(16px,3vh,40px) 20px}.fp .hero .w{width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}.fp .hero h1{font-size:clamp(28px,min(5.2vw,7.5vh),64px);margin-bottom:clamp(8px,1.6vh,18px)}.fp .hero p{font-size:clamp(15px,min(1.6vw,2.6vh),19px)}.fp .hero .btns{margin-top:clamp(12px,2.6vh,28px)}.fp .hero .ppl{margin-top:clamp(12px,3vh,40px);width:100%}.fp .hero .ppl img{width:auto!important;height:auto!important;max-width:100%!important;max-height:clamp(180px,44vh,520px)}</style><div class=\"fp\"><section class=\"c hero\"><div class=\"w\">\n<h1>Your VAT number, finally simple</h1>\n<p>Registration, invoices, taxes and tax return in one place, with a real accountant by your side.</p>\n<div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"b p\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/contact/#inizia\">Talk to us</a><a class=\"b\" href=\"#come-funziona\">How it works</a></div>\n<div class=\"ppl\"><img src=\"__BASEURL__/assets/foto/hero-persone.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling craftsperson, freelancer and shopkeeper\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:900px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\"></div></div></section></div>"
  },
  {
    "id": "come-funziona",
    "nome": "How it works",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<div class=\"fp\"><section id=\"come-funziona\"><div class=\"w\"><div class=\"c\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\"><h2>Working with a VAT number, without the bureaucracy</h2></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"n\">01 · VAT number registration</div><h2>Open your VAT number in a few days</h2><p>We choose the right ATECO code and tax regime together, then we handle the paperwork.</p></div><div class=\"viz\">🚀</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"n\">02 · A tax partner</div><h2>Your accountant, when you need one</h2><p>A dedicated person who knows your situation and answers your questions.</p></div><div class=\"viz\">🤝</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"n\">03 · Invoices and taxes</div><h2>E-invoices and a forecast of your taxes</h2><p>Issue invoices and see in advance how much to set aside for taxes and contributions.</p></div><div class=\"viz\">🧾</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"n\">04 · Answers in chat</div><h2>Questions? Real people answer</h2><p>Write whenever you have a doubt: no call centre, no endless waiting.</p></div><div class=\"viz\">💬</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"n\">05 · Tax return</div><h2>Tax return prepared and filed</h2><p>We check everything, prepare your F24 payments and remind you of every deadline.</p></div><div class=\"viz\">✅</div></div></div></section></div>"
  },
  {
    "id": "per-chi",
    "nome": "Who it is for",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<div class=\"fp\"><section class=\"gr c\"><div class=\"w\"><h2>Your work, your clients first</h2><p>Whether you have just started or have been invoicing for years, taxes should stay a detail.</p><div class=\"chips\"><span>Craftspeople</span><span>Freelancers</span><span>Consultants</span><span>Creators</span><span>Sales agents</span><span>Regulated professionals</span><span>Small shops</span><span>E-commerce</span></div></div></section></div>"
  },
  {
    "id": "cta",
    "nome": "Consultation",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<div class=\"fp\"><section id=\"inizia\" class=\"c\"><div class=\"w\"><h2>Talk to a tax consultant</h2><p>Free first consultation, no obligation. Tell us about your activity and we will tell you how to proceed.</p><div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"b p\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/contact/\">Request a free consultation</a></div></div></section></div>"
  },
  {
    "id": "faq",
    "nome": "FAQ",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"gc-sec gc-soft\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"gc-wrap\"><h2 class=\"gc-h2\">Frequently asked questions</h2><details style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--gc-line);padding:1rem 0\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;cursor:pointer\">Is the flat-rate regime really worth it for me?</summary><p style=\"margin-top:.7rem\">It depends on revenue, costs and type of activity. The flat-rate regime applies a coefficient to your turnover and does not deduct actual costs: with high expenses it may not be the best choice. In the free consultation we compare the options using your own figures.</p></details><details style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--gc-line);padding:1rem 0\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;cursor:pointer\">Can I switch to you with a VAT number already open?</summary><p style=\"margin-top:.7rem\">Yes. We need your business details and your latest tax return: we explain what to do with your current accountant and how the handover works.</p></details><details style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--gc-line);padding:1rem 0\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;cursor:pointer\">What happens if I exceed the 85,000 euro threshold?</summary><p style=\"margin-top:.7rem\">You leave the flat-rate regime from the following year, or immediately if you exceed 100,000 euro. We warn you in advance and guide you through the switch to the simplified or ordinary regime.</p></details><details style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--gc-line);padding:1rem 0\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;cursor:pointer\">Does the first consultation cost anything?</summary><p style=\"margin-top:.7rem\">No, it is free and non-binding: it helps you understand whether and how to open a VAT number, which regime to choose and how much to set aside.</p></details></div></section></div>"
  },
  {
    "id": "contatti",
    "nome": "Contact",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"gc-sec gc-dark\" id=\"contatti\"><div class=\"gc-wrap\"><p class=\"gc-eyebrow\">Contact</p><h2 class=\"gc-h2\">Let us talk about your VAT number</h2><p class=\"gc-lead\">Write us a couple of lines about what you do: we will reply with a free first assessment.</p><a class=\"gc-btn\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/contact/\">Write to us</a><p style=\"margin-top:1.2rem\">Or write to <a class=\"gc-link\" href=\"mailto:info@studiocommercialista.it\">info@studiocommercialista.it</a></p></div></section></div>"
